1
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:43,000
She grips my arm with fingers hard as steel,

2
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:49,000
Surrounded by the smell of boiling meal.

3
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:55,500
Her wooden spoon clacks twice upon the pan.

4
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000
A sudden verdict on a helpless man.

5
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:09,500
Dance lessons call, and terror grips my chest!

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,200
My safe, predictable logic is oppressed.

7
00:01:16,799 --> 00:01:22,500
No circuit board can shield me from the crowd.

8
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:29,500
I hear their mocking giggles ring out loud!

9
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:47,500
I know binary code and frequency,

10
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:53,799
But touching girls is pure absurdity.

11
00:01:54,200 --> 00:02:00,000
My palms will leak with sweat, my tongue turn dry.

12
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:07,000
How can I dance when panic blinds my eye?

13
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:13,800
Sunday is coming, and the trap is set,

14
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:20,500
My safe electronic haven meets its threat.

15
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:26,500
No volume knob to turn the room away,

16
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:33,199
I freeze in terror as I face the day!

17
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:39,000
Mary Lier... a sentence served in ice,

18
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:45,500
To touch a living girl and pay the price.

19
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:51,800
No headphones now, no wires to disappear.

20
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:58,000
Trapped on the floor with all my deepest fear.